{"id": "97110116", "name": "אינטגרל מסוים לפי ניוטון–לייבניץ – חזקה, פולינום, 1/tⁿ או cos(kt), כולל חיבור קטעים", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>חשבו את</p>[[if test=\"{{CT:4}}\"]]<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ I=\\int_{ {{CT:0}} }^{ {{CT:1}} } {{CT:2}}\\,dt \\]</p>[[/if]][[if test=\"{{CT:5}}\"]]<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ I=\\int_{ {{CT:0}} }^{ {{CT:3}} } \\left({{CT:2}}\\right)dt+\\int_{ {{CT:3}} }^{ {{CT:1}} } \\left({{CT:2}}\\right)dt \\]</p>[[/if]]<div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(I=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\">רשמו ערך מדויק (שבר, או למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">sqrt(2)/4</code>).</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> לפי משפט ניוטון–לייבניץ, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\int_a^b f(t)\\,dt=F(b)-F(a)\\)</span> כאשר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(F\\)</span> פונקציה קדומה של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — פונקציה קדומה</b><br>[[if test=\"{{CT:5}}\"]]לפי האדיטיביות של האינטגרל, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\int_a^c f+\\int_c^b f=\\int_a^b f\\)</span>, ולכן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ I=\\int_{ {{CT:0}} }^{ {{CT:1}} } \\left({{CT:2}}\\right)dt \\]</p>[[/if]]פונקציה קדומה של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f(t)={{CT:2}}\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ F(t)={{CT:6}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — הצבת הגבולות</b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ I=F\\left({{CT:1}}\\right)-F\\left({{CT:0}}\\right)={{CT:7}}-\\left({{CT:8}}\\right)={{CT:9}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "int,integrate,diff", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "-ta", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">קיבלתם את הנגדי של התשובה: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\int_a^b f=F(b)-F(a)\\)</span>, ולא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(F(a)-F(b)\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["Fh", "Fl", "Fp", "ab", "af", "bb", "dd", "hi", "kc", "kind", "lo", "lst", "mid", "mq", "